-   Share your **name** and **pronouns**.\
-   Describe your **relationship to physics**:
    -   How have you encountered physics (school, work, curiosity, barriers)?\
    -   What emotions or associations come up when you hear "physics"?\
-   **One way your identity shapes your experience** in science.

> *Physics is not neutral. Our starting point is not “from nowhere,” but from our lived positionalities.*

